WEBVTT

00:12:59.263 --> 00:13:01.337
if I ever have children --

00:13:01.361 --> 00:13:03.976
what I am going to --

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.287
who I was.

00:13:05.311 --> 00:13:07.562
So I do something
that's very narcissistic --

00:13:07.586 --> 00:13:09.078
I am a blogger --

00:13:09.102 --> 00:13:11.562
that is an amazing thing for me,

00:13:11.586 --> 00:13:14.561
because it captures
a moment in time every day.

00:13:14.585 --> 00:13:17.845
I take a picture of myself --
I've been doing this since last year --

00:13:17.869 --> 00:13:19.174
every single day.

00:13:19.198 --> 00:13:21.024
And, you know, it's the same picture;

00:13:21.048 --> 00:13:22.805
it's basically the same person.

00:13:22.829 --> 00:13:24.408
Only a couple of people read it.

00:13:24.432 --> 00:13:26.285
I don't write this for this audience;

00:13:26.309 --> 00:13:30.316
I'm showing it now, but I would go
insane if this was really public.